{% doc %}
  About Signs ByLITA page, shown on the about-us handle in the V1.5 theme.
{% enddoc %}
<article class="sbl-info sbl-info--about">
  {% render 'sbl-info-hero',
    eyebrow: 'About us',
    title: 'About Signs ByLITA',
    text: 'Custom signs for businesses, buildings and homes — your sign, your words. All custom orders are customized in the US.',
    aside_label: '',
    aside_text: ''
  %}
  <div class="sbl-info-stats" aria-label="Signs ByLITA at a glance">
    <div class="sbl-info-stat"><strong>10+ years</strong><span>making signs</span></div>
    <div class="sbl-info-stat"><strong>1 million+</strong><span>signs sold across the USA</span></div>
    <div class="sbl-info-stat"><strong>5,000+</strong><span>ready-made signs</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="sbl-info-body">
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>Signs ByLITA makes custom and ready-made signs for offices, restaurants, schools, churches, clinics, warehouses, hotels, vacation rentals and homes — anywhere people need clear, good-looking signs.</p>
    <p>We're part of the LITA family of brands, a U.S. team with more than a decade of experience in signs, plaques and identification products. All custom orders are customized in the US and shipped directly to you.</p>
    <p>When you order from Signs ByLITA, a real team handles your order from start to finish.</p>

    <h2>What we make</h2>
    <p>We specialize in signs designed by you. Our online sign designer lets you choose a shape, type your own wording, pick colors and size, and see a live preview before you buy — whether you need one sign for an office door or a matching set for an entire building.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Custom wall and door signs — your wording, in our full range of shapes, sizes and colors</li>
      <li>Ready-made signs — thousands of popular signs, from restroom and office signs to safety and private property notices</li>
      <li>Desk signs and nameplates — names and titles for every desk</li>
      <li>Plaques and awards — recognition for employees, teams and volunteers</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Why customers choose us</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Customized in the US — all custom orders are personalized here, then shipped to you</li>
      <li>No artwork or setup fees — design your sign online in minutes, no files to send</li>
      <li>Fast production — most orders ship within 2 business days</li>
      <li>No minimums — order one sign or hundreds</li>
      <li>Real people behind it — questions are answered by our actual team, not a bot</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Our commitment</h2>
    <p>We believe a great sign shouldn't need a sign shop visit, a graphic designer or a three-week wait. Our goal is to make ordering simple, affordable and exactly right — every time.</p>

    <h2>The LITA family</h2>
    <p>Signs ByLITA works alongside our sister brands: <a href="https://allqualitybadges.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">All Quality Badges</a> for custom name badges, <a href="https://www.gavelsfast.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gavels Fast</a> for gavels and presentation sets, and <a href="https://www.designsbylita.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Designs ByLITA</a> for home decor and gifts.</p>

    <div class="sbl-info-actions">
      <span>Ready to get started?</span>
      <a class="sbl-info-btn sbl-info-btn--gold" href="/products/custom-sign">Design your sign now</a>
      <a class="sbl-info-btn sbl-info-btn--ghost" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Shop ready-made signs</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
